# Cost Optimization

## Mục tiêu

Cost Optimization là quá trình reduce chi phí infrastructure và operations trong khi vẫn maintain performance và reliability. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, cost optimization không phải là cutting corners mà là làm cho systems efficient hơn và sử dụng resources một cách thông minh hơn. Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers và operators trong việc identify opportunities cho cost savings, implement optimizations, và maintain visibility vào chi phí.

Cloud costs có thể spiral out of control nếu không được monitor và optimize. Tuy nhiên, cost optimization không nên compromise reliability hoặc performance. Rule này cover strategies cho compute, storage, networking, và data costs.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Cost Visibility**

Track costs by service. Monitor by tenant if multi-tenant. Use cost allocation tags. Set up budget alerts. Regular cost reviews.

**2. Right-Sizing**

Use appropriate instance sizes. Don't over-provision. Monitor utilization. Right-size regularly. Use auto-scaling.

**3. Resource Optimization**

Delete unused resources. Stop idle resources. Use spot/preemptible instances. Schedule non-production. Use serverless when appropriate.

**4. Storage Optimization**

Use appropriate storage classes. Implement lifecycle policies. Compress data. Delete old data. Use caching.

**5. Data Transfer Optimization**

Minimize data transfer. Use CDN. Compress in transit. Cache responses. Optimize API calls.

**6. Pricing Model Selection**

Use reserved instances for steady loads. Use spot for fault-tolerant. Use on-demand for spikes. Consider savings plans. Evaluate pricing models.

**7. Architecture Optimization**

Design for cost. Use managed services. Implement caching. Use event-driven. Microservices vs monolith cost.

**8. Automation**

Automate resource management. Implement schedules. Auto-scale based on demand. Delete old resources. Cost-aware CI/CD.

**9. FinOps Practices**

Involve finance in cost decisions. Chargeback/showback to teams. Set cost targets. Regular optimization reviews. Cost as a feature.

**10. Continuous Improvement**

Monitor cost trends. Identify anomalies. Test optimization strategies. Iterate improvements. Share learnings.

